<title>BAHRAIN: PRESS DIGEST - Bahrain - May 5.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Bahrain - May 5.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are some of the leading stories in the Bahraini press on Monday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>BAHRAIN TRIBUNE</p>
<p>- Tourism is vital for Bahrain because it employs 17 percent of the workforce and is nine percent of the country's gross domestic product, commerce minister says.</p>
<p>GULF DAILY NEWS</p>
<p>- Bahrain's cabinet agrees on plans to convert Bahrain Duty Free into a public shareholding company.</p>
<p>AKHBAR ALKHALEEJ</p>
<p>- Bahrain tourism company to pay 10 percent dividend to shareholders.</p>
